  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fKoS1gYy.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/KoS1gYy.png</a>)</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252f586mulZ.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/586mulZ.png</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模组是 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">RED LOGIC</span></strong></span> 系列的一员。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/logicates\" rel=\"nofollow\">Logicates</a> • 增强工作台<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">增强工作台添加了 2 个……呃，改进型合成桌！它们能够存储内部的物品。制作站（来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinker's Construct</a> 由 SlimeKnights 制作）是两者中较简单的版本，而</span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 项目台（来自 Eloraam 的 RedPower 2）还额外提供了两行存储空间，助你在各种微缩合成冒险中游刃有余。</span>  </p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>功能特性</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含 RedPower 2 的项目台；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含匠魂（TiC）的制作站；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">游戏内显示物品，完全可配置；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a> 集成；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Items</a> 集成；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整支持 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crafting-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crafting Tweaks</a> 集成；</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Discord</strong></span>\n<br><br></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fG4PjhEf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&v=2\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
